NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY	public environment variable name the front-end config rule allows, not a code
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY	public environment variable name the front-end config rule allows, not a code
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL	public environment variable name the front-end config rule allows, not a code
